{"id":"5f22ec6ce7325e767048f38dd1d64a46ff436d06","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/live/earnings-live-updates-130425228.html","title":"Earnings live updates: The Trade Desk stock plummets on earnings miss, Wendy's cuts outlook","site_name":"Buzzing","source":"finance.yahoo.com","byline":"Yahoo Finance","excerpt":"Earnings continue to be the market's engine, and a series of results this week from Palantir, SpaceX, and AMD are set to rev up stocks again.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"main-content-wrapper\">  <article data-testid=\"article-content-wrapper\">     <div><p><a data-ylk=\"elm:author;elmt:link;itc:0;source:content-canvas%20default;slk:Yahoo%20Finance;sec:content-canvas\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;author&quot;,&quot;yLinkElementType&quot;:&quot;link&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;Yahoo Finance&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;}\" href=\"/author/yahoo--finance\" target=\"_self\"><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0A0ACF0EC18AAC222F80FE408BA6F6D729A0CC57A71802FE671BB23D1AB87F5F/subgraphmysterio/resizefill_w80_h80;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fo.aolcdn.com%2Fimages%2Fdims%3Fimage_uri=https%253A%252F%252Fs.yimg.com%252Fos%252Fcreatr-uploaded-images%252F2021-11%252F40621510-496f-11ec-bade-b5da9b9bb6b2&compress=1&progressive=1&quality=75&client=hawkeye&signature=5841425766d3c70312da70fc666899b924bf6740\" alt=\"Yahoo Finance\" loading=\"eager\">  </a></p> <div> <p>Updated <time datetime=\"2026-08-07T12:01:31+00:00\" data-timestamp=\"2026-08-07T12:01:31+00:00\">Fri, August 7, 2026 at 8:01 AM EDT</time> <span>1 min read</span></p></div></div>   <div data-testid=\"article-body\">        <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Earnings continue to roll in, driving the stock market to <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/live/stock-market-today-tuesday-august-4-dow-sp-500-nasdaq-100140227.html\" data-ylk=\"slk:new%20highs;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:1;pos:1;_E:mb_qualified_link;ct:story;outcm:mb_qualified_link;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;new highs&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\">new highs</a>.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>        <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->On Friday, Vistra Corp. (<a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/VST/\" data-ylk=\"slk:VST;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:2;pos:1;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;VST&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;2&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\">VST</a>), Take-Two Interactive Software (<a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TTWO/\" data-ylk=\"slk:TTWO;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:3;pos:1;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;TTWO&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;3&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\">TTWO</a>), Oklo (<a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/OKLO/\" data-ylk=\"slk:OKLO;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:4;pos:1;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;OKLO&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;4&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\">OKLO</a>), Under Armour (<a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/UA/\" data-ylk=\"slk:UA;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:5;pos:1;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;UA&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;5&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\">UA</a>), and Wendy's (<a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/WEN/\" data-ylk=\"slk:WEN;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:6;pos:1;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;WEN&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;6&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\">WEN</a>) report to cap a busy week of reports.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>        <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Overall, it's shaping up to be a <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/article/earnings-season-is-about-to-kick-off--2-charts-reveal-how-it-may-go-135222405.html\" data-ylk=\"slk:strong%20earnings%20season;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:7;pos:1;_E:mb_qualified_link;ct:story;outcm:mb_qualified_link;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;strong earnings season&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;7&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\">strong earnings season</a> for the S&amp;P 500 (<a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EGSPC/\" data-ylk=\"slk:%5EGSPC;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:8;pos:1;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;^GSPC&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;8&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\">^GSPC</a>). According to <a href=\"https://advantage.factset.com/hubfs/Website/Resources%20Section/Research%20Desk/Earnings%20Insight/EarningsInsight_073126.pdf\" data-ylk=\"slk:FactSet%20data;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:9;pos:1;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;FactSet data&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;9&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">FactSet data</a>, analysts estimate the year-over-year S&amp;P 500 earnings growth rate for the second quarter will be 47.5% — surging past the five-year average of 16.4% and the 10-year average of 10.3%.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>        <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->If that holds, it will mark the second consecutive quarter of earnings growth above 20% for the index and the seventh straight quarter of double-digit growth.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>          </div> <span> </span> </article>      </div></DIV>","content_text":"Updated Fri, August 7, 2026 at 8:01 AM EDT 1 min read Earnings continue to roll in, driving the stock market to new highs. On Friday, Vistra Corp. (VST), Take-Two Interactive Software (TTWO), Oklo (OKLO), Under Armour (UA), and Wendy's (WEN) report to cap a busy week of reports. Overall, it's shaping up to be a strong earnings season for the S&P 500 (^GSPC). According to FactSet data, analysts estimate the year-over-year S&P 500 earnings growth rate for the second quarter will be 47.5% — surging past the five-year average of 16.4% and the 10-year average of 10.3%. If that holds, it will mark the second consecutive quarter of earnings growth above 20% for the index and the seventh straight quarter of double-digit growth.","fetched_at":"2026-08-07T12:20:40.866Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<p>Updated <time datetime=\"2026-08-07T12:01:31+00:00\" data-timestamp=\"2026-08-07T12:01:31+00:00\">Fri, August 7, 2026 at 8:01 AM EDT</time> <span>1 min read</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Updated Fri, August 7, 2026 at 8:01 AM EDT 1 min read","zh":"更新于 2026 年 8 月 7 日星期五，美国东部时间上午 8:01 阅读时间 1 分钟"}]},{"html_en":"<p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Earnings continue to roll in, driving the stock market to <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/live/stock-market-today-tuesday-august-4-dow-sp-500-nasdaq-100140227.html\" data-ylk=\"slk:new%20highs;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:1;pos:1;_E:mb_qualified_link;ct:story;outcm:mb_qualified_link;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;new highs&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\">new highs</a>.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Earnings continue to roll in, driving the stock market to new highs.","zh":"盈利持续增长，推动股市创出新高。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->On Friday, Vistra Corp. (<a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/VST/\" data-ylk=\"slk:VST;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:2;pos:1;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;VST&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;2&q